detailedExplanation.whatItIs:
Loop safety is a set of budgets and checks around the loop. Conceptually:
for step in range(max_steps):
    if elapsed() > time_limit or spent() > cost_budget:
        break
    action = model(context)
    if is_dangerous(action):
        require_confirmation(action)
    if no_progress(action):
        break
    ...
